Modelica source:
```modelica
connector Port
  Real e;
  flow Real f;
end Port;
model Leaf
  Port p;
end Leaf;
model Hub
  Port boundary;
  Leaf n1;
  Leaf n2;
equation
  connect(boundary,n1.p);
  connect(n1.p,n2.p);
end Hub;
model Study
  Hub h;
end Study;
```

Question:
Within the equation scope of model instance Study.h, return the canonical signed member vector for the primitive flow connection set generated there that contains h.boundary.f.

Target:
h.boundary.f

Answer format:
Use ascending path:integer entries joined by commas without spaces; coefficients must be primitive, nonzero, and oriented so the first coefficient is positive.
